{"ID":"20240118151141-di0pz74","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151141-di0pz74","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151141-di0pz74\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151141-xnfvauf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122125502-p2avld2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122125502-p2avld2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:15,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:15\u0026#125;","title":"177石龙芮","type":"doc","updated":"20240124114630"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151141-xnfvauf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151141-xnfvauf","updated":"20240122125440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，平，无毒。治风寒湿痹，心腹邪气，利关节，止烦满。久服轻身、明目、不老。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125445-uslwsdd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125445-uslwsdd"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":" 一名鲁果能。一名地椹。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125444-q3t8gzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125444-q3t8gzx"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产山东等地，生川泽石边，子入药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125448-hds0sxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125448-hds0sxn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125449-icynnqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125449-icynnqj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】石龙芮主治风寒湿痹，利关节，养胃气，能强阴益精。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125451-f6vzuie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125451-f6vzuie"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】平肾胃气，补阴气不足，失精茎冷，令人皮肤光泽有子。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125452-iavxv2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125452-iavxv2y"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】逐诸风，除心热燥。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125454-y05dh6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125454-y05dh6w"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125455-e5ytmv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125455-e5ytmv3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】宜大戟为使，畏茱萸蛇蜕皮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125441-2j7ohay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125441-2j7ohay"}},{"ID":"20240122125456-zjck7bg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125456-zjck7bg"}},{"ID":"20240122125456-stwj2ae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125456-stwj2ae","updated":"20240122125502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接着我们再看这个一七七，石龙芮这个药呢，我们这个现代人，没有什么人使用，风寒湿和利关节我们有很好的处方，很好的药。因为这个药取得不是很方便，所以一般别的地方都没有，它不够普及。至于说能够我们要去风湿寒热，风湿关节炎的痛啊，关节不利呀，胃气呀什么的，我们用别的药就可以。"}]},{"ID":"20240122125502-p2avld2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125502-p2avld2","updated":"20240122125507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位看看我们有这味药就可以了。"}]}]}